  ('5c943338-6951-5408-9711-225893982bef', 'ea65b685-d0c0-5aa8-bb8d-d6bb01f68d36', 'Boat rental station — collecting information', 'A lake station rents out **boats** to tourists. The boatman writes every rental in a **copybook**: the customer''s name, phone number, boat number, start time and return time. In the summer there are **long queues**, some boats are rented to two customers at the same time, and the owner cannot see how much money the station earns each day. The owner hires an analyst to investigate before a new computerised system is developed.', 'structured', 10, 'exam', null, 'AI', 11, 'b670c685-56c9-5476-89b6-b0c02cd8dec7', 'ef6ad158-e13f-5d40-b84a-4d0072e4fdb7', '{}'::jsonb, 'nis_style', null, false, 'published', null, null, 0),
