  ('1776e986-619c-591a-8b7f-fe891b4f73b7', 'ea65b685-d0c0-5aa8-bb8d-d6bb01f68d36', 'Analysing the survey results', 'The analyst gave a questionnaire to **250 tourists**. One closed question was *"How long did you wait to rent a boat?"*

