  ('9a8955cb-b3ce-53b9-8aff-b28ae438668c', 'ea65b685-d0c0-5aa8-bb8d-d6bb01f68d36', 'Choosing a solution', 'The analyst considers three alternative solutions:

- **A** — buy an off-the-shelf rental app with a monthly subscription;
- **B** — have a bespoke rental system written for the station;
- **C** — keep the copybook but employ a second boatman in summer.

Each solution is given a score from 1 (poor) to 5 (very good) for each criterion. The owner gives each criterion a weight.

| Criterion (weight) | A | B | C |
|---|---|---|---|
| Cost (3) | 4 | 2 | 5 |
| Meets the requirements (4) | 3 | 5 | 1 |
| Time to introduce (2) | 5 | 1 | 4 |', 'structured', 10, 'exam', null, 'AI', 11, 'b670c685-56c9-5476-89b6-b0c02cd8dec7', 'ef6ad158-e13f-5d40-b84a-4d0072e4fdb7', '{}'::jsonb, 'nis_style', null, false, 'published', null, null, 0),
