  ('8ccec5bc-272b-5489-985b-57d22c35c2da', 'ea65b685-d0c0-5aa8-bb8d-d6bb01f68d36', 'Testing a cipher function', 'The function below should shift every lowercase letter of a word to the next letter of the alphabet (a → b, b → c …).

```text
FUNCTION Encrypt(text)
    alphabet ← "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"
    result ← ""
    text ← lower(text)
    FOR i ← 0 TO LENGTH(text) - 1
        FOR j ← 0 TO 25
            IF text[i] = alphabet[j] THEN
                result ← result + alphabet[j+1]
            ENDIF
        ENDFOR
    ENDFOR
    RETURN result
ENDFUNCTION
```

Note: `lower()` returns the string with all letters in lowercase.', 'structured', 5, 'exam', null, 'AI', 12, '90094a74-5e7b-589b-af06-e75a04fd67d7', '8059a656-8438-52e8-8a2f-6c72039cd26e', '{}'::jsonb, 'original', null, true, 'published', null, null, 0),
