  ('258d8a7b-f745-554b-a766-5175641314ec', 'ea65b685-d0c0-5aa8-bb8d-d6bb01f68d36', 'Binary search (a)', 'Complete the pseudocode.

```pseudocode
1   INPUT name
2   low ← 0
