  ('75266935-3bdf-5e38-8f74-6a41191b59b7', 'ea65b685-d0c0-5aa8-bb8d-d6bb01f68d36', 'Substitutions', 'In a football game, 11 players are on the field, and 3 substitute players are waiting to play. It is allowed to make three substitutions. When a substitution is needed, the coach selects the player on the field and the substitute player, swaps them and updates his data.

Array fieldP represents the players on the field. Array subP represents the substitute players.

For example, at the beginning of a game:

`fieldP = [11, 2, 8, 4, 5, 10, 7, 3, 9, 6, 1]`

`subP = [12, 13, 14]`

At the end of that game:

`fieldP = [11, 2, 8, 4, 13, 10, 14, 12, 9, 6, 1]`

