  ('04ccec24-6e6c-5951-bbca-6b8713826ef9', '3fbba70c-2694-51d5-9a2a-2262521552e4', 1, true, 'Advantages (max 2): criminals / missing people found faster; works 24/7; analyses huge amounts of video humans could not; may deter crime / safer streets
Disadvantages (max 2): loss of privacy / mass surveillance of innocent people; false matches — innocent people stopped / bias against some groups; data could be hacked / misused by the government; expensive
A balanced answer with points linked to the scenario for 4.', '[{"criterion":"First advantage linked to the scenario","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second advantage","marks":1},{"criterion":"First disadvantage linked to the scenario","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second disadvantage","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'The cameras could find wanted criminals and missing children much faster than police watching videos, and they work 24 hours a day, which may make the streets safer. However, everyone''s movements would be recorded, which is a serious loss of privacy for innocent people. The system can also make false matches, especially if it was trained on biased data, so innocent people might be stopped by the police.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Maximum 2 if only advantages or only disadvantages are given.', null),
  ('81994c33-356d-5069-883a-d04ee9a76f6c', 'ba724823-e671-5e62-b34b-2320f0a5afa3', 1, true, '- It learns from data — the students'' previous answers (1)
- to predict / choose suitable exercises and improves as it receives more answers, without the rules being programmed (1)', '[{"criterion":"Learns from students'' data","marks":1},{"criterion":"Predicts / improves without programmed rules","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'It learns from data — each student''s previous answers — and uses the patterns it finds to choose suitable exercises, improving as more answers are collected rather than following fixed programmed rules.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('59a8a8d5-1fd2-53c1-9517-20ac927b9d74', '7e4bd076-0aa6-5c28-b674-36bf3685446c', 1, true, 'Advantage (1): personalised learning / own pace; instant feedback; available any time; focuses on weak areas
Disadvantage (1): personal data collected / privacy; less contact with teachers / no empathy; may make wrong choices / bias; over-reliance; needs devices / Internet', '[{"criterion":"Valid advantage","marks":1},{"criterion":"Valid disadvantage","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Advantage: each student gets exercises at the right level for them. Disadvantage: a lot of personal data about each student is collected.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('bf7ca805-28d0-5845-af20-4c8ec72b6af1', '7b91c20a-9105-5cc4-8048-b4b00a38a441', 1, true, '- AR adds 3D models / information to the real view, e.g. a beating heart appears on the desk / over a textbook (1)
