  ('48b7524b-475f-56ed-9ac3-ba980bcbba7d', '3f9c0f99-90d7-5a0e-b197-58388f2cafc0', 1, true, 'Why better (max 3): member / trainer details repeated in every visit — redundancy (1); update anomalies / inconsistency when a phone number changes (1); wasted storage (1); no unique identifier — names not unique (1)
