  ('f45c36ff-372b-5059-b28b-6ec057ccef0a', 'c08dd676-8c34-5a35-b82d-237a5aa1cc0b', 1, true, 'Any three linked to the scenario (1 each): members must book classes online / in an app; the system must show the number of free places; the system must stop bookings when a class is full; the system must send a confirmation; the receptionist must be able to view / change bookings; members must log in', '[{"criterion":"Requirement 1","marks":1},{"criterion":"Requirement 2","marks":1},{"criterion":"Requirement 3","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 Members must be able to book classes online. 2 The system must stop accepting bookings when a class is full. 3 The system must send each member a booking confirmation.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Requirements must be different and come from the scenario.', null),
  ('4307b7fe-2c45-50af-9453-9bea6442e00e', '0f1e7f5c-0cf8-57dd-9fe5-abfbd4ce7a48', 1, true, 'Interview (1): the analyst asks the boatman / owner questions face to face and can ask follow-up questions

Questionnaire (1): a set of written questions given to many tourists / customers, who answer them on paper or online

Observation (1): the analyst watches the boatman serving customers / how the copybook is used and records what happens', '[{"criterion":"Interview described","marks":1},{"criterion":"Questionnaire described","marks":1},{"criterion":"Observation described","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Interview: the analyst talks to the boatman and asks prepared and follow-up questions. Questionnaire: written questions answered by many tourists. Observation: the analyst watches the boatman serving customers and notes problems.', '{}'::jsonb, 'A description must say what the method involves, not just repeat its name. Accept descriptions not linked to the scenario.', null),
  ('2395f66e-ce33-58f9-92a8-6118f7e0b55a', '09012590-32c6-57fe-89f0-28d02ab33a20', 1, true, 'Interview (1): detailed answers; follow-up questions possible; questions can be explained; the boatman knows the problems best

