  ('d3eec674-f68e-5e9f-84ea-80e2f7599cc1', 'cb703076-6ed9-5c94-84b2-5fa87c03125e', 1, true, 'A / the off-the-shelf app (1) — follow through from the totals in (a)', '[{"criterion":"Solution with the highest total (A)","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Solution A — the off-the-shelf app.', '{"values":["A","solution A","the off-the-shelf app","off-the-shelf","off the shelf app"]}'::jsonb, 'Follow through: credit the solution with the highest total calculated by the student in (a).', null),
  ('f25c673d-5b1b-5dee-8e18-aa05991741c0', '21bad4c3-323e-5c11-9c27-7d7932b61ff6', 1, true, 'Up to 4 points, each referring to both (1 each):
- A is cheaper to buy / B is expensive to develop
- A is available at once / B takes a long time to develop
- B meets the station''s requirements exactly / A may not have every feature needed or has unneeded features
- A is widely tested with support from the supplier / B relies on one developer
- A has an ongoing subscription cost / B is owned by the station
- B can be changed when the station''s needs change / A cannot be changed', '[{"criterion":"Comparison point 1","marks":1},{"criterion":"Comparison point 2","marks":1},{"criterion":"Comparison point 3","marks":1},{"criterion":"Comparison point 4","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'The off-the-shelf app is cheaper and can be used immediately, whereas the bespoke system is expensive and takes months to write. The bespoke system would meet the station''s requirements exactly, while the app may lack some features. The app is tested by many users and supported by the supplier, but it needs a monthly subscription, while the bespoke system belongs to the station.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Points must compare both solutions. Max 4.', null),
  ('7ac36f3b-130f-50e3-b592-634226879688', '4c845ef9-56b0-56ec-932b-0b12ed9597a8', 1, true, 'Factor (1) + explanation (1), e.g.: hardware needed (1) — the station may need to buy tablets / internet access (1); ease of use / training (1) — the boatman must be able to use it quickly (1); legal feasibility / data protection (1) — customers'' names and phone numbers are personal data (1); support and reliability (1) — the system must work during the busy season (1); security / backups (1)', '[{"criterion":"Identifies a relevant factor","marks":1},{"criterion":"Explains why it matters for the station","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Data protection: the system stores customers'' names and phone numbers, which are personal data, so the solution must keep them secure and follow the law.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('220b3721-741f-5da0-9d23-d09769b6e313', '9c29079f-50d3-59b3-bffb-8710b473da79', 1, true, 'Any three linked to the scenario (1 each): record each rental with customer, boat and times; show which boats are free / prevent a boat being rented twice at the same time; calculate the price / record payments; produce a daily income report; allow online / advance booking to reduce queues; send a reminder when the rental time ends', '[{"criterion":"Requirement 1","marks":1},{"criterion":"Requirement 2","marks":1},{"criterion":"Requirement 3","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 The system must record each rental with the customer, boat number and start and return times. 2 The system must stop a boat from being rented to two customers at the same time. 3 The system must produce a report of the money earned each day.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Requirements must be functional (what the system does), different from each other and linked to the scenario.', null),
  ('afd2ddba-dcad-5062-8342-297768a214a1', '1790a132-76c0-5047-b108-e21b9e21e98b', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): speed (e.g. a rental recorded in under 30 seconds); security (only the owner sees income / password protection); usability (the boatman can use it without training); reliability / availability during opening hours; data backed up daily; works on a tablet / phone', '[{"criterion":"First non-functional requirement","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second, different non-functional requirement","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 A rental must be recorded in less than 30 seconds. 2 Only the owner, with a password, can see the income reports.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Do not credit functional requirements here.', null),
  ('3213573c-ecc9-5e2b-91de-b1bcc58d151c', 'c559f77e-c6aa-50fd-89f0-b111c40a10d9', 1, true, '- So that the developer knows exactly what to build / avoids misunderstanding (1)
