  ('30873f26-2036-5668-816a-93c56a3e3746', '9365c329-af6f-53ca-9fd2-9aad38e5e2aa', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): gives one agreed definition of each field; helps programmers build the database / write code correctly; keeps names, types and sizes consistent across tables; records validation rules — improves data integrity; helps maintenance / new developers; part of technical documentation', '[{"criterion":"First purpose","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second purpose","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'It gives programmers a clear definition of every field, so the database is built consistently, and it helps future developers understand and maintain the database.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
