  ('7604df91-6b42-58f8-8a2c-586781056b0a', 'fe14a84c-a1d6-5336-b14d-9da23a5fa55c', 1, true, 'Data converted into a special code / scrambled using an algorithm and a key (1); cannot be understood without the key, so stolen / intercepted data is useless, e.g. in transit (1)', '[{"criterion":"Coded with key","marks":1},{"criterion":"Unreadable without key","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Encryption scrambles the data with an algorithm and a key, so anyone who intercepts or steals it cannot read it without the key.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
