  ('9a61687c-3b08-552a-aa41-53b8f90c0958', 'b8970b3a-a079-5739-9eb1-b1a7a49d7632', 1, true, 'Hardware: separate device / in the router, protects every device on the network (1); software: installed on one computer, protects that device and can control which programs use the network (1)', '[{"criterion":"Hardware","marks":1},{"criterion":"Software","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'A hardware firewall is a separate device that protects the whole network, whereas a software firewall runs on one computer and protects only that device, controlling which of its programs may use the network.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('3d760a17-b465-5f3a-bc51-da84159b20d2', '4c38b1fb-1adf-5663-b3b7-bd8153701c5f', 1, true, 'Worm: self-replicates across networks without user action (1). Trojan: disguised as useful software, installed by the user, opens backdoor (1). Spyware: secretly records activity / keystrokes and sends to attacker (1)', '[{"criterion":"Worm","marks":1},{"criterion":"Trojan","marks":1},{"criterion":"Spyware","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Worm: copies itself through the network by itself. Trojan: looks like useful software, so the user installs it, then it opens a backdoor. Spyware: secretly records what the user does and sends it to the attacker.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('5b2bea62-dad9-5267-9277-429d621a5c8b', 'fd4290c4-862f-590f-bf11-7d130971dc92', 1, true, 'Any four effect / consequence points (1 each): data deleted / corrupted → work lost; customer data stolen → identity theft, fines, loss of trust; network slowed / crashed by worm → downtime, lost sales; backdoor lets attackers return / install ransomware; recovery costs', '[{"criterion":"1","marks":1},{"criterion":"2","marks":1},{"criterion":"3","marks":1},{"criterion":"4","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'The worm can overload the network so staff cannot work and orders are lost. Spyware can steal customers'' personal data, leading to fines and loss of trust. The Trojan''s backdoor lets attackers return later, and cleaning all the computers costs time and money.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('9eea979c-c80b-543b-93a5-ac3f85c9ae16', '76910199-7d19-5b57-a1dd-a930618c0df9', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): slow / crashing; pop-ups / unknown programs; missing or changed files; e-mails sent without the user; antivirus disabled; unusual network activity', '[{"criterion":"1","marks":1},{"criterion":"2","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 The computers became very slow.
