- while loop with mysqli_fetch_assoc (1)
- echo of both fields with line break (1)', '[{"criterion":"SQL","marks":1},{"criterion":"Query","marks":1},{"criterion":"Loop fetch","marks":1},{"criterion":"Output","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '```php
<?php
