  ('d1d15ee6-18f5-5dcf-841f-3a4ccd7b50c1', 'b587fe03-01a0-5c82-a406-a2e3af749e8e', 1, true, '- counter initialised and incremented (1)
- loop for at most three iterations (1)
- input inside the loop (1)
- PIN checked inside the loop (1)
- exit loop when correct / success message (1)
- attempts-left message and Card blocked after 3 failures (1)
Accept any correct alternative / language.', '[{"criterion":"Counter","marks":1},{"criterion":"Three iterations","marks":1},{"criterion":"Input in loop","marks":1},{"criterion":"Check in loop","marks":1},{"criterion":"Exit when correct","marks":1},{"criterion":"Messages","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '```javascript
let attempts = 0;
let ok = false;
