- Documentation is produced at every stage (1) which meets the agency''s requirement for complete documentation (1)
- Clear stages and milestones (1) so the agency can monitor progress / cost and time can be estimated (1)', '[{"criterion":"Reason 1 identified","marks":1},{"criterion":"Reason 1 explained using the scenario","marks":1},{"criterion":"Reason 2 identified","marks":1},{"criterion":"Reason 2 explained using the scenario","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 The tax rules are fixed by law, so all requirements can be written at the start and the inflexibility of waterfall is not a problem. 2 Waterfall produces documentation at the end of every stage, which meets the agency''s demand for complete documentation.', '{}'::jsonb, 'The explanation mark needs a link to the scenario (fixed law, documentation, monitoring). Do not credit the same reason twice.', null),
  ('dcdb5041-4f3d-587e-ab6d-2ac4a2be879f', 'be57aeeb-edbc-5216-b21b-2f65deb458f4', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): inflexible — changes are difficult / expensive once a stage is finished; the client sees the working system only at the end; errors are found late (testing after coding); little user involvement during development; not suitable when requirements are unclear or likely to change; long projects may no longer meet users'' needs when finished', '[{"criterion":"First disadvantage","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second, different disadvantage","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 Changes are hard to make once a stage has been signed off. 2 The client only sees a working system at the end.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('63abe0db-0902-57da-a6fd-db3488ecfb70', '88bcf9a1-808a-550d-b844-c6f1b25313aa', 1, true, 'Testing (stage) (1) — accept: during testing near the end of the project / acceptance testing', '[{"criterion":"Testing","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'The testing stage.', '{"values":["testing","the testing stage","testing stage"]}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('30bcc38e-6f81-56d0-a4b5-10333be70f4f', '3c441481-cf05-5578-9630-ea4996fc882c', 1, true, '- The team plans / selects features (user stories) from the backlog for the sprint (1)
