3 Develop and test the next version / engineering (1)
4 Evaluate (client review) and plan the next iteration / loop (1)', '[{"criterion":"Phase 1: objectives / requirements","marks":1},{"criterion":"Phase 2: risk analysis / prototype","marks":1},{"criterion":"Phase 3: develop and test","marks":1},{"criterion":"Phase 4: evaluate and plan the next loop","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 Determine the objectives of the loop. 2 Analyse the risks and reduce them, e.g. with a prototype. 3 Develop and test the next version. 4 The client evaluates it and the next loop is planned.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Accept the phases in any wording; one mark per correct phase even if not in order.', null),
  ('b8205876-0eac-5455-88e6-b5a133896726', '62832b2e-6543-5875-9cf2-b87ea875e14b', 1, true, '- The project is high-risk / large / expensive (1)
