  ('c1e081f8-3230-5858-a6e8-331a696118b7', '5d49d623-5bb0-50e3-8d90-ce0774bf8a6f', 1, true, 'Up to 4 marks.
- Off-the-shelf is cheaper — suits the small budget (1)
- Off-the-shelf is available immediately — needed next week; bespoke takes four months (1)
- Off-the-shelf is well tested / has support and tutorials (1)
- Bespoke would match the clinic''s exact requirements / unique features (1), but the clinic''s needs are common / simple (1)
- Conclusion: off-the-shelf (special-purpose) software, justified by the scenario (1)', '[{"criterion":"Cost point linked to the small budget","marks":1},{"criterion":"Time point linked to ''next week'' vs four months","marks":1},{"criterion":"Valid point about bespoke (benefit or drawback)","marks":1},{"criterion":"Justified conclusion","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Off-the-shelf software is cheaper because many clinics share its cost, which suits the small budget, and it can be installed immediately, while the bespoke system would take four months. Bespoke software would fit the clinic''s exact needs, but booking appointments is a common task, so ready-made software will do it. The clinic should buy off-the-shelf software.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Points must be linked to the scenario for full marks. A conclusion for bespoke can get at most 2 marks.', null),
