- Competitors cannot buy the same system (1) so it gives the bank a competitive advantage / unique features for customers (1)', '[{"criterion":"Valid reason","marks":1},{"criterion":"Expansion of the same reason","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'The bank owns the code, so it can add new features or fix security problems whenever it needs to, without waiting for another company.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('ca66dc57-0571-58e7-8fe2-3ed8c79706f5', '7c6229f1-2648-5aad-8dc9-e29f6ad93b03', 1, true, '- Makes copies of the bank''s data / files on another medium / location / the cloud (often automatically on a schedule) (1)
