  ('adde5579-3273-5795-b1b7-d0fdf9ef00b9', 'f4916560-a5f7-5f9f-b26d-ee024cc33d3b', 1, true, 'Spreadsheet (max 2): cheap / may already be owned; flexible; but teachers must build tables and formulas themselves / more errors / not designed for reports

Gradebook (max 2): designed for this task / ready-made reports; available immediately; cheaper than bespoke; but may not follow the school''s own grading rules / unneeded features

Bespoke (max 2): exactly fits the school''s rules / links with the timetable; but expensive and slow to develop; fewer users so bugs may remain

Recommendation (1–2): a justified choice linked to budget / time / how unusual the requirements are', '[{"criterion":"Valid evaluation of the spreadsheet","marks":1},{"criterion":"Valid evaluation of the gradebook","marks":1},{"criterion":"Valid evaluation of bespoke","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second valid point for any option","marks":1},{"criterion":"Clear recommendation","marks":1},{"criterion":"Recommendation justified by comparing options","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'A spreadsheet is cheap and the school probably already has it, but teachers would have to create their own formulas and report layouts, which takes time and can cause errors. A special-purpose gradebook is designed for recording marks and producing reports, is available immediately and is tested by many schools, but it may not follow the school''s own grading rules. A bespoke system would match the school''s rules exactly and could link to its timetable, but it is expensive and would take months to develop. I recommend the gradebook, because recording marks is a common task, so the school gets the needed features quickly at a much lower cost than bespoke software.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Any justified recommendation can get full marks. Do not award marks for describing the categories without evaluating them.', null),
  ('9c4f55c3-2661-5d10-90f3-e6cf4f2c4547', 'dde5af9d-c5d3-51c4-8f1c-dc63365550c2', 1, true, 'OS → System; Antivirus → System; Printer driver → System; Word processor → Application; Game → Application

