  ('186f4f0a-7f5d-5ebf-854b-ba117c3aca7b', '3a8071bc-5267-5530-9d1c-8171812f8223', 1, true, 'Per way: method (1) + drawback (1). Lower sampling rate – high frequencies lost / lower quality; lower sample resolution – less accurate, more noise; mono – no stereo effect; lossy compression (MP3) – data permanently lost; shorter recording – less content.', '[{"criterion":"Way 1","marks":1},{"criterion":"Drawback 1","marks":1},{"criterion":"Way 2","marks":1},{"criterion":"Drawback 2","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 Reduce the sampling rate — fewer samples so the sound is less accurate. 2 Record in mono — the left/right stereo effect is lost.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
