- Text only (1) so it cannot be used for graphics (1)', '[{"criterion":"Valid disadvantage","marks":1},{"criterion":"Explanation","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'A small typing mistake in a command could delete or change the wrong files, and there is often no way to undo it.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('e43c0c57-4a00-5a8d-b876-d8f8e0489965', 'e16fb8a6-d464-5ea8-9755-2d6284348368', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): microphone records the speech; speech recognition converts speech to text; natural language processing finds the meaning / intent; answer given with speech synthesis', '[{"criterion":"First valid step","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second valid step","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Speech recognition converts his voice into text, and natural language processing analyses the words to work out what he is asking.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('01347277-4615-51b9-8a31-d16364416c3f', 'afa15531-72b2-5800-a33b-8010b72343ad', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each), linked to him: does not need to see a screen / poor eyesight; no need to learn commands or use a keyboard; hands-free; speaks naturally; quick to ask questions / call family', '[{"criterion":"First valid advantage","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second, different valid advantage","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 He does not need to read a screen, which suits his poor eyesight. 2 He does not need to learn any commands — he can just speak normally.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('ff8c4792-414f-51b1-a94f-08d25cb240fb', '8e78a219-6b97-5c53-820b-587ec20aceef', 1, true, 'Disadvantage (1) + explanation (1), e.g.
