- He may need to learn specific phrases (1) because it does not understand colloquial speech (1)', '[{"criterion":"Valid disadvantage","marks":1},{"criterion":"Explanation","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'If the TV is on in the background, the speaker may not recognise his words correctly, so it could carry out the wrong request.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('a4d9cd5a-9eee-5fb7-b463-516abfa1532b', '03689026-2c1f-5573-8e2e-8992130b382d', 1, true, 'Any one (1): it is always listening; conversations may be recorded / stored on the company''s servers; recordings could be hacked / shared with third parties', '[{"criterion":"Valid privacy concern","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'It is always listening, so private conversations could be recorded and stored by the company.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('ee126cc7-99e6-57e4-b919-3c49b02f02eb', '880b42f2-7c72-56d6-8dcc-8515683893e7', 1, true, '- Surgeons can control the screen without touching it (1)
