  ('378e5346-c657-5df8-ac41-f1971d468385', 'be4694e0-d4bd-53c5-94ef-dca21649f4a1', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): over-reliance / students stop thinking for themselves; cheating with AI writing tools; incorrect or unfair automatic marking; privacy — student data collected; less human contact / no empathy; unequal access to devices', '[{"criterion":"First valid risk","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second, different valid risk","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 Students may use AI to write their essays instead of learning. 2 A lot of personal data about students is collected.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('e13e1e84-abaf-5077-8218-5d7248d7d357', '45404625-ca4e-525f-a136-802812ebfc4f', 1, true, 'True.', '[]'::jsonb, null, '{"correct":true}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('852608aa-70df-58a3-9c83-2a04587368c0', 'efe72477-9fae-5176-872f-6d33f8c87429', 1, true, 'Any three (1 each):
- The AI (deep learning) is trained on many images (X-ray / MRI / CT) labelled by doctors
- It learns the patterns / features of a disease (e.g. tumour, fracture)
- A new scan is analysed and areas of concern are highlighted / a diagnosis is suggested
- It is fast / can be as accurate as specialists / a doctor checks the result', '[{"criterion":"Trained on labelled images","marks":1},{"criterion":"Learns patterns of disease","marks":1},{"criterion":"Analyses new scans and highlights / suggests diagnosis","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'A deep-learning system is trained on thousands of X-ray images that doctors have labelled. It learns the patterns that show a disease such as pneumonia. When a new X-ray is analysed, it highlights suspicious areas and suggests a diagnosis, which a doctor then checks.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('c91747c8-1736-541c-bd67-58e6df1a2f12', 'fb0a8bbe-569d-53b7-89de-a0be1012f533', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): drug discovery; personalised treatment / dose; robot-assisted surgery; monitoring patients / wearables; predicting which patients will get worse; tracking epidemics; chatbots / appointment booking; speech-to-text medical notes', '[{"criterion":"First valid use","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second, different valid use","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 Discovering new medicines. 2 Smart watches that detect an irregular heartbeat.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('cd154dc7-9a40-57bf-8b06-dd8b8c448d48', '02ca542b-dbbe-57b5-b411-c19ae5e84bed', 1, true, 'Problem (1) + explanation (1), e.g.
