  ('89610c5c-032c-5dd5-89c0-f7334b9ffd44', '1e15fc4e-a738-5c69-bce5-f11a64abe7c7', 1, true, 'Positive (1): convenience / 24/7 services; safety (fewer accidents, fraud prevented); accessibility; new jobs / growth; help with climate / disease
