  ('666e83a5-1098-501e-8cd2-fec2da5f4277', 'ef3b0b7e-3500-5120-9d52-66f42f094c9c', 1, true, 'Benefits (max 2): patients get expert-level diagnosis without travelling; faster results / earlier treatment; works 24/7; the remote doctor only checks highlighted cases
