  ('6bc7597a-9bfb-5f01-a609-1ae0ca7ca388', 'e1185fe4-f901-5686-956b-ce32b93736ec', 1, true, 'Positive (max 2): fewer breakdowns / less downtime; higher quality / less waste; 24/7 production; safer work; new skilled jobs
