  ('e1b6d7cd-337a-52ba-af31-0636c85fa993', '3da36153-b2de-5a3a-b204-0e889d01f7a5', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each), both sides: guaranteed deadlines vs good average speed; strict priority vs time-sharing / fairness; deterministic vs variable response; small embedded vs large; minimal vs rich interface', '[{"criterion":"First","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 An RTOS guarantees a response within a deadline, whereas Windows aims for good average speed. 2 An RTOS is small and embedded with little interface, whereas Windows has a rich GUI.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
