  ('bae2c1a2-5b8f-5b3d-9d25-d58099300685', 'eed03f5e-d0fe-561d-8f88-bd633c441e09', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): splits data into segments; adds port numbers so data reaches the right application; sequence numbers / correct order; error control / acknowledgements; retransmission of lost segments; flow control', '[{"criterion":"Function 1","marks":1},{"criterion":"Function 2","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'It splits data into segments with port numbers so the data reaches the right application, and it checks that all segments arrive, resending any that are lost.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
