  ('91ee14f1-f8ad-536d-a7e0-5725c2a74e74', '66178764-0562-50b7-ac11-7a4e659086ab', 1, true, '- Doctors'' knowledge can be stored as facts and rules (e.g. symptoms → disease) (1)
