- Rewrite copied text in their own words (paraphrase) or put exact words in quotation marks (1)
- Cite every source in the text and in a reference list / bibliography (1)
- Do not use the other school''s report without acknowledgement — it is someone else''s work / copyright (1)
- Re-check the report after changes; exclude quotes / bibliography from the score (1)
[Max 4]', '[{"criterion":"Check matches","marks":1},{"criterion":"Quote or paraphrase","marks":1},{"criterion":"Cite sources","marks":1},{"criterion":"Further justified action","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'The group should read every highlighted passage. Where they copied text, they should either rewrite it fully in their own words or put the exact words in quotation marks, and cite Wikipedia and the other school''s report in the text and in the reference list. They must not present the other school''s work as their own. Then they should run the check again.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('fe9c007b-dd8f-55e6-bb74-4e792244b94c', 'e90af270-a263-54ce-a066-b091bbf2d0bb', 1, true, 'Presenting others'' work / ideas as own (1) without acknowledging the source (1)', '[{"criterion":"Others'' work","marks":1},{"criterion":"No acknowledgement","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Presenting another person''s work as your own without acknowledging the source.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('3658fd75-e166-5b88-bdcd-d6938e41f222', 'e80b1677-5383-5677-924b-4268a6eed1c5', 1, true, 'L1–Mosaic, L2–Translation, L3–Direct. One mark per line.', '[]'::jsonb, null, '{"pairs":{"L1":"R1","L2":"R2","L3":"R3"}}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('824c1eec-4703-5db7-af5f-75d4d2882c96', 'd3f6c585-2196-5aae-99e7-5d3e2932d919', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): zero marks; disqualification; loss of trust / reputation; disciplinary action; no learning; legal action', '[{"criterion":"First","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '1 The report gets zero marks. 2 The student may be disqualified from the exam.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
