  ('ca3edf3d-1e41-5998-81d8-7eefc9acead8', '785e0482-6b21-51c5-86d4-9345f6cfea5d', 1, true, 'Advantage (1): intuitive / easy to learn; recognition of icons; fewer errors; WYSIWYG; multitasking; graphics
