  ('09fd45fc-c958-59d9-b281-897cc64d2385', '8ed87521-e4e9-5a94-8ec2-c024df416063', 1, true, 'Advantages: the server does not need a complex operating system and so does not use unnecessary computing resources (1); can run complex commands / scripts (1); faster for experts; remote access
