  ('f662af2c-d2e1-5352-9a22-0774621565d7', 'c0f1a443-c0cf-5d5e-96c8-aa381e95cc57', 1, true, 'Natural language (1): ambiguous, leading to misinterpretation of user input; may struggle with colloquial language, homophones or context-based queries; users may need to learn specific phrases; accents / noise
