  ('64271d56-d1cf-5e5c-aa33-4abd30f73324', '011fbd85-e3a9-546a-9d15-4eef03d8f4af', 1, true, 'True.', '[]'::jsonb, null, '{"correct":true}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('56473ea2-785e-5415-a0f8-56ef5a08d77d', 'd03524ec-2277-5f53-b322-b2bc73fe27d8', 1, true, 'Any three (1 each): camera / depth sensor captures images many times per second; software detects the hand and tracks key points; movement compared with stored gesture patterns / machine learning model; recognised gesture triggers a command', '[{"criterion":"First","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second","marks":1},{"criterion":"Third","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'A depth camera takes many images per second; software finds the hand and tracks the positions of the fingertips; the movement is compared with stored gesture patterns, and when one matches, the linked command is carried out.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('d6414d9c-8b53-5276-aa15-e4dcbe6aedfa', '56d8de12-5fd7-5197-ba64-cb1073387517', 1, true, 'B', '[]'::jsonb, null, '{"correct":"B"}'::jsonb, null, 'Gestures are touchless and not affected by noise; voice recognition fails in noise.'),
  ('7cf8a4aa-b755-5e21-bb7b-f81ed6f69321', '5302b87e-cab7-5d7b-8381-d2ed53c79a3b', 1, true, 'L1–R1, L2–R2, L3–R3, L4–R4. One mark per correct match.', '[]'::jsonb, null, '{"pairs":{"L1":"R1","L2":"R2","L3":"R3","L4":"R4"}}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('747b102a-0d2b-58a3-8e68-856865268a42', 'f0f9d948-3dd7-5db5-a94b-9106373aa352', 1, true, 'Servers CLI (1); blind student NLI (1); chef gesture (1); photos GUI (1)', '[{"criterion":"Row 1","marks":1},{"criterion":"Row 2","marks":1},{"criterion":"Row 3","marks":1},{"criterion":"Row 4","marks":1}]'::jsonb, null, '{"rows":[[null,"","✓","",""],[null,"","","✓",""],[null,"","","","✓"],[null,"✓","","",""]]}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('8a53e633-0e33-5ed8-81f0-c27d49c29598', '49ab4550-0433-5649-8630-abbf3db94c95', 1, true, 'Up to 4: GUI — familiar, precise, but driver must look away / take hand off wheel (1); voice — hands-free, eyes on road, but noise / accents / misinterpretation (1); gesture — no need to look, but limited commands / accidental gestures (1); justified recommendation linked to safety (1)', '[{"criterion":"GUI evaluated","marks":1},{"criterion":"Voice evaluated","marks":1},{"criterion":"Gesture evaluated","marks":1},{"criterion":"Recommendation","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'A touchscreen is familiar and precise, but the driver must look away from the road to use it. Voice control lets the driver keep both hands on the wheel and eyes on the road, although road noise or accents may cause mistakes. Gestures need no screen, but only a few commands are possible and accidental movements may trigger them. Voice control is best, with a simple touchscreen for when the car is parked, because safety requires eyes on the road.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('a9e5c116-d053-5d4a-9367-90d5a8e02196', '00f2905b-a0e4-55b4-a387-629bd9d4997c', 1, true, 'Advantages: the server does not need a complex operating system and does not use unnecessary computing resources (1); can run complex commands (1)
Disadvantages: must remember commands (1); errors in typing (1)', '[{"criterion":"Advantage","marks":1},{"criterion":"Disadvantage","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Advantage: it can run complex commands and scripts. Disadvantage: the administrator must remember exact command syntax.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
  ('a79f0fd2-150f-52c3-9981-a32c4ee8ebc0', 'aaceaecf-96a2-5b9a-9bee-56f879be23b4', 1, true, 'CLI displays only text / no graphics needed (1); more memory / CPU left for the server''s tasks (1)', '[{"criterion":"Text only","marks":1},{"criterion":"Resources for server tasks","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'The CLI shows only text, so no memory or processing power is spent on drawing graphics and more is available for the server''s work.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
