  ('11d41d4f-507e-588b-88f4-f8b8b085b253', 'd1bae69a-1203-51f4-81f4-0d0e360d131b', 1, true, 'Any two (1 each): separate image for each eye — 3D depth; head tracking updates the view; blocks out the real world / wide field of view; hand controllers / gloves to handle instruments; haptic feedback; spatial sound; high frame rate', '[{"criterion":"First valid feature","marks":1},{"criterion":"Second valid feature","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'It shows a different image to each eye to create 3D depth, and it tracks the surgeon''s head so the view of the virtual patient changes as they move.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
