  ('29097a92-1e28-5e21-94c5-662b2c4b94d1', 'e0301697-6553-5aa7-b15c-12a9a1d67e00', 1, true, 'Loop to calculate the total and average (1); second loop comparing each element with the average (1); counter incremented and output (1)', '[{"criterion":"Average","marks":1},{"criterion":"Comparison loop","marks":1},{"criterion":"Count and output","marks":1}]'::jsonb, '```pseudocode
Total ← 0
FOR i FROM 0 TO 6
    Total ← Total + Temp[i]
ENDFOR
Avg ← Total / 7
