  ('adc86c6a-0ede-5dcf-b9b5-2116e0f98076', '46dcfc64-5690-5945-bab4-0734c1728daa', 1, true, 'Validate transactions and group them into a block (1); compete to solve the puzzle — change the nonce until the hash meets the target — and the winner adds the block and is rewarded (1)', '[{"criterion":"Validate / build block","marks":1},{"criterion":"Solve puzzle / reward","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'Miners check transactions and put them into a block, then repeatedly change the nonce until the block''s hash meets the difficulty target; the first to succeed adds the block and earns a reward.', '{}'::jsonb, null, null),
