  ('3942ecf4-9f14-5f0b-8d36-977e999d57df', '23613ca5-7dc7-5d46-9d73-2d4bcc69aa85', 1, true, 'initialized counter of attempts AND increment counter (1)
use loop for three iteration (1)
input in the loop (1)
check correctness pin in loop (1)
exit from loop if pin is correct (1)
output message about counter of attempts / about attempts are ended (1)
Example:
```javascript
attempts=1
while (attempts<=3)
{
    pin = prompt("Input your PIN-code:")
    if (pin==''1234'')
    {
           alert("You entered successfully");
           break;
    }
    attempts++;
    alert("You have”, 4 – attempts, “attempts”);
}
if attempts == 4
