  ('5686d009-4571-5666-98d7-0de1faba9649', 'f5c49758-7a0b-58c0-9480-b2d3977ae244', 1, true, '- A DNS server will contain a list of domain names/ A DNS server will contain a list of corresponding IP addresses (1)

- The browser checks the local (cached) host file to check if it already holds the IP address (1)

- The local (your domain) DNS server is queried for the IP address (1)

- If the local DNS server does not hold the IP address, then the query is passed to another DNS server at a higher level until the IP address is resolved (1)

- The address is passed on to DNS severs lower in the hierarchy (1)

- When the full address has been resolved, the IP address is then passed to your browser (1)

- The browser then connects to the IP address of the server and downloads the web site. (1)
[Max 5]', '[{"criterion":"A DNS server contains a list of domain names or corresponding IP addresses","marks":1},{"criterion":"The browser checks the local cached host file to check if it already holds the IP address","marks":1},{"criterion":"The local DNS server is queried for the IP address","marks":1},{"criterion":"If the local DNS server does not hold the IP address, the query is passed to another DNS server at a higher level until resolved","marks":1},{"criterion":"The address is passed on to DNS servers lower in the hierarchy","marks":1},{"criterion":"When the full address has been resolved, the IP address is passed to the browser","marks":1},{"criterion":"The browser connects to the IP address of the server and downloads the web site","marks":1}]'::jsonb, 'A DNS server contains lists of domain names and corresponding IP addresses. When a domain name is entered, the browser may check a local cached host file first. If needed, the local DNS server is queried for the IP address. If it does not have the address, the query is passed to higher-level DNS servers until the IP address is resolved, then the address is passed back down the hierarchy to the browser. The browser then connects to the server’s IP address and downloads the website.', '{}'::jsonb, 'Max 5.', null),
